                <pb facs="0872" n="752" xml:id="pg752"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-29"><hi rendition="#italic">July 29,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>British embassy informs me that Russian foreign office notified them that shells
                    were found on board <hi rendition="#italic">Oldhamia.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Meyer.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
